"href=\"http://setiathome.ssl.berkeley.edu/index.html\">SETI@home</a> "
"instances running on your computer or in your network. It shares the same "
"look-and-feel of the popular <a "
"href=\"http://members.shaw.ca/mloukko/SETI.html\">SETIWatch</a> "
"tool for the Windows platforms, written by Mark Loukko.</p>"
